=================================================================
PASS criteria (Gate-0 kernel-correctness branch):
  C0a  HMTA at p=8 has rel_L2 error <= 0.20 vs flat-SDPA at
       true_rank r in {4, 8} (the design's target regime).
  C0b  Median rank-p retention >= 0.85 at p = 8 for r <= 8.
  C0c  HMTA production FLOPs <= 1/10 of flat-SDPA at T = 16384.
  C0d  SDPA-recovery error at p = s0, eta = Nc is < 1e-3.
=================================================================
